Act as a senior full-stack software architect, sportsbook systems engineer, API integration specialist and frontend developer with extensive experience building production-grade online betting platforms.

Your assignment is to integrate the supplied SmartBet Online API routes into the existing SmartBet website frontend.

This is an integration and implementation assignment, not a demonstration or a UI redesign exercise.

You must first understand the existing application architecture, inspect its source code, identify the current frontend components, state management, routing, authentication, betting slip, wallet and existing data structures, and then integrate the APIs into the existing application.

Primary objective: Deliver a fully operational online sportsbook frontend that retrieves real data from SmartBet APIs and allows customers to register, log in, browse prematch and live events, select odds, place bets, manage their accounts, deposit money and request withdrawals.

Do not build a separate application. Work within the existing SmartBet website and preserve its established design, branding, layout and functionality.

